  "name": "capnproto-rust",
  "description": "A Rust implementation of the Cap’n Proto serialization protocol and capability-based RPC system. The project implements a zero-copy data representation strategy by directly mapping the C++ reference implementation's memory layout and pointer mechanics onto Rust's memory model. It provides a core serialization library alongside a compiler plugin for generating type-safe Rust bindings from Cap’n Proto schema definitions.",
